description:
## Goal

Make reached local `case` and `with else` dispatches contribute typed coverage evidence from the same demanded activation attempt, then delete the source-AST coverage authority.

## Model

A lowered local `Dispatch` already calls `calculate_dispatch_reachability` with the value types reaching that site. In that same `AnalyzeActivation` attempt, retain failure reachability under a typed semantic match-site identity and contribute it through the warning model established by fz-kdt.36.1. Do not add a local warning job, store, scheduler, root owner, or post-analysis pass.

Match kind and semantic site are typed identity. Diagnostic code, construct wording, rendered type text, source span, and source order are projection/provenance, never identity. Multiple activations contribute through the ordinary fact ledger and the retained diagnostic product deduplicates by semantic site.

Analyze a local miss entry only when typed reachability says failure is possible. A `case` miss and an uncovered `with else` miss halt and may warn. A `with` without `else` returns its failed value and is not this diagnostic. A `receive` miss means keep searching/waiting and never becomes no-matching-clause evidence.

## TDD

Prove first:

- `case :a` with only an `:a` arm is warning-free;
- a reached `:a | :b` subject with only an `:a` arm warns, and removing the `:b` path retracts it;
- `with else` follows the same typed rule; `with` without `else` does not warn;
- a nested match inside an unreachable function clause or branch creates no work, evidence, diagnostic, or dependency;
- guarded rows retain the real guard-false fallthrough path;
- two activations supporting one local site have OR support and exact last-support retraction;
- location-only replacement moves only diagnostic provenance/snapshot;
- receive behavior and diagnostics are unchanged;
- identical/unrelated requests preserve semantic, product, backend, and native allocations/generations and start zero warning work;
- FIFO, LIFO, and permutation produce identical typed evidence and rendering.

## Required cutover and deletion

Extend the final warning model from fz-kdt.36.1. Remove `source_diagnostics::check_match_clauses`, its AST walk, guard-normalization diagnostic shortcuts, and production `is_inexhaustive`/`plan_for_analysis` once no semantic consumer remains. Delete duplicate diagnostic plan construction and single-clause/guard escape-hatch tests that existed only for the untyped pass.

Update pattern-matching, semantic-fixpoint, pipeline, fixtures, diagnostics, and user guides in the same commit. Full focused, causal, replacement, fixture, CLI, formatting, check, and strict-Clippy gates pass.
